             of its box against the arrow's ~75%.
           - :root-ish id moved to #s5-scene (the script targets it by id, and the
             stitcher renames a composition root to "<id>-slot")
           - the baked macOS arrow swapped for the house pointing hand, with the click
             transformOrigin moved to its measured tip (38.6% 25%)
           - the cursor now LEAVES the frame entirely (top 135%) instead of fading out
